From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Taiyou06 <kaandindar21@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Mar 2025 21:23:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Leaf - Async chunk packet preparation

Co-authored-by: hayanesuru <hayanesuru@outlook.jp>
Ported from Leaf 26.2 and adapted for Canvas/Folia.

Chunk packet serialization can be a significant region-thread cost when many
players join, teleport, or fly into fresh view-distance areas at the same time.
Snapshot the mutable block-entity/heightmap inputs on the owning region thread,
then prepare ClientboundLevelChunkWithLightPacket on Canvas' bounded network
worker pool. Completed packets are drained and registered by the owning player
chunk loader, preserving region-thread bookkeeping.

